  "pull_request": {
    "number": 229,
    "title": "Add while and loop UI coverage for unnecessary_host_function_call",
    "body": "## close #133 \r\n\r\n## Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR expands the UI test corpus for `unnecessary_host_function_call` by adding coverage for `while` and `loop` constructs, matching the existing loop-kind coverage already present for `soroban_storage_in_loop`.\r\n\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n- Added a `while` loop fixture that triggers `unnecessary_host_function_call`.\r\n- Added a `loop {}` fixture that triggers `unnecessary_host_function_call`.\r\n- Updated `soroban_cost_lints/ui/main.stderr` with the expected diagnostics.\r\n- No lint logic or diagnostic behaviour was modified.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\nVerified with:\r\n\r\n- ✅ `cargo fmt --all -- --check`\r\n- ✅ `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`\r\n- ✅ `cargo test --workspace`\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\n\r\nThis PR is intentionally limited to UI fixture coverage for different loop kinds. It does not introduce new lint behaviour or alter existing diagnostics.\r\n\r\nCloses #<issue-number>\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Local Test Output\r\n\r\nPaste the full output of:\r\n\r\n```bash\r\ncargo fmt --all -- --check\r\ncargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings\r\ncargo test --workspace\r\n```\r\n\r\nbefore submitting the PR.",
